{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地金雞獎影帝朱一龍早期拍攝的古裝劇《文成傳奇》（原名《王陽明》），在塵封長達14年後，終於正式落實全國上星播映日期，將於11月17日晚上7時35分登陸貴州衛視黃金時段首播。</p><p>消息一出隨即引發劇迷熱烈討論，紛紛直呼是「有生之年系列」，期待一睹</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T12:25:18.673532+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T12:01:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T12:18:07.221761+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T12:18:07.221761+00:00","content_hash":"0ae18a8ab54ebb19565379b27e8c3a83f5effd524b41423b1f4b796b89d48a30","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}